  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5257d476da0c416c",
      "translationZh": "在我的单张 RTX 5090 上使用 llama.cpp 运行 Qwen 3.8 Flash Next 时，它的表现让我有些失望。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb6a9aa523f5371b",
      "translationZh": "一个问题是，llama.cpp 仍未为 MoE 模型实现专家缓存（Expert Caching）。目前有各种 PR 和讨论（例如，参见这里），但尚未合并任何相关改动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65a88bd232d63c73",
      "translationZh": "随后，我偶然发现了 FreeToken，它声称能够“在你已有的硬件上释放数据中心级的智能”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfc0162e4a4dbb63",
      "translationZh": "借助它，我能够以以下性能运行 3.8 Flash Next：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9882908fb707bf72",
      "translationZh": "TG ~ 50 t/s（约为 40-60，取决于缓存的效果），即使在较长上下文下也相当稳定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8241b6f7a8b92436",
      "translationZh": "这实际上已经能用了，多亏了专家缓存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6fe0eaffa03cc2f",
      "translationZh": "（统计数据来自 FreeToken 日志）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d8b8cc5f29d27fe",
      "translationZh": "RTX 5090，128 GB DDR5 6000（96 GB 应该也能正常运行），Intel 270K Plus",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e67a1b96a9bbf0a",
      "translationZh": "使用的模型：nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4（这里给出的建议之一——务必将其转换为 FreeToken 格式，否则每次启动都会很慢）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b180b931a215392",
      "translationZh": "它也适用于其他 MoE 模型。所以，即使你只能运行 Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B 这样的模型，只要还有一些可用于缓存专家的空闲 VRAM，也可以试试看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "190539c35d8e3369",
      "translationZh": "项目仍处于早期阶段——刚刚实现了视觉功能。目前还没有 KV 量化，也没有 MTP。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8a6a61cc6bbd30d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/dir3ctly 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
